+---
+category: Enhancements
+authors: [agent]
+---
+
+Plan ranged and approximate schedule amounts at the lowest value they allow: money going out at its largest outflow, money coming in at its smallest inflow (e.g. a salary "between 1,010.00 and 2,000.00" plans at 1,010.00)
